      "reasons": [
        "This is a fresh review of the Quan Lộc candidate; no earlier Tài Bạch or Phúc Đức acceptance is used as evidence or authorization.",
        "The 巨門 entry explicitly juxtaposes 天機同在卯宮吉美 and 在酉宮雖美無始終. The latter inherits the immediately named Thiên Cơ co-location subject and selects Dậu, so the proposed host pair plus Dậu AST is an exact locator for this textual branch.",
        "The immediately following paragraph is retained and was read in full: 陷宮遭悔吝，加羊陀火鈴空劫更不美，退宮卸職. It matters to an integrated interpretation. The proposal explicitly says the adverse conditions have not been evaluated and makes no dismissal, failed-career, or other whole-career assertion.",
        "For this exact attributed annotation, resolving the full modifier system is not necessary: the claim is that the source records the quoted words for the named branch, not that the branch supplies a sufficient final prediction despite every modifier. Therefore adverse-host and expanded-TPTC-adverse fixtures can legitimately match this annotation. This reasoning would not authorize the same AST attached to an unqualified career conclusion.",
        "The complete Quan section, including the reciprocal 天機 paragraph with 見羊陀火鈴方宜 and 陷宮退官失職, was inspected. Those clauses cannot be silently promoted to exceptions, absence requirements, or override rules for this specific textual branch. No reconciliation of the complete modifier system is claimed.",
        "The full general-star context records Thiên Cơ at 卯酉 as 旺地 and Cự Môn at 卯酉 as 入廟. The fixture engine marks observed at Dậu do not authenticate equivalence between source 旺 and engine M. No brightness operator is used, and the separate Menh/general-star birth-stem conditions are not imported into Quan.",
        "The exact Vietnamese wording leaves 雖美無始終 as a source quotation, names the correct co-located stars and Dậu, and expressly limits itself to the textual branch with unevaluated adverse modifiers. It does not import the Mão 吉美 conclusion, impose yin-stem conditions, or assert an observed life event.",
        "Independent replay of all 10 supplied solar inputs used repository solarToLunar, hourBranchIndex, calculateTuVi, normalizeChart, and evaluateCondition. Lunar records, functional hosts, branch values, and all expected predicate statuses matched. The branch operator with branches array is executable; no palace_branch operator or handwritten chart is used."
      ],
